  "details": "The Voice parameter is for volume intensity while the Viseme parameter itself is an integer that corresponds to the Oculus SDK. To achieve lipsync blending similar to how the SDK handles visemes, we would need the ability to blend between each viseme, as not every viseme will have a solid 0 to 1 transition. multiplying the values of each viseme when interpreted by the microphone would help match the Oculus SDK to a tee",
